630
00:40:40,921 --> 00:40:41,991
<i>É.</i>

631
00:40:43,957 --> 00:40:45,300
Desculpe.

632
00:40:50,430 --> 00:40:52,706
O que está acontecendo?

633
00:40:52,799 --> 00:40:54,278
Não sei.

634
