645
00:41:37,244 --> 00:41:38,746
Tem?

646
00:41:38,845 --> 00:41:41,223
<i>Sim, bem aqui.</i>

647
00:42:00,500 --> 00:42:02,309
O mar é grande, amigo!

648
00:42:02,636 --> 00:42:06,311
Acharam um peixe <i>em</i> Madagascar
